* d(An,Xn) on a 68020 with a value known only further on (a difference of labels, an equate):
* the brief form in both r68s, as for a value known before (a value out of 8 bits is an error
* in both; Ultra C's r68 and C 3.2's R68020, checked 2026-10-16); gas made it the full format
* with a 16-bit displacement.
* options: -m2
* expect text: 4e71 2a702014 2a7020ec 10311014 1031100a 4e71 4e71 51fc
Val_b equ 10
 psect index_brief_later,0,0,0,0,0
Lab_a nop
 movea.l Lab_b-Lab_a(a0,d2.w),a5
 movea.l Lab_a-Lab_b(a0,d2.w),a5
 move.b Val_a(a1,d1.w),d0
 move.b Val_b(a1,d1.w),d0
 nop
Lab_b nop
Val_a equ 20
 ends
